Third-party material
====================

Some test fixtures and the UI demo data contain transcripts that NVIDIA
NeMo-Speech.cpp produced from these recordings. The transcripts are
derivative works of the recordings and are used under their licences.

AMI Meeting Corpus
  Meeting EN2002d, Mix-Headset, a 60 s excerpt from 2132.5 s (as shipped in
  NVIDIA NeMo-Speech.cpp test_files/diar/ami_en2002d_2132.wav).
  https://groups.inf.ed.ac.uk/ami/corpus/
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: transcribed by machine (Nemotron 3.5 ASR Streaming); the text
  contains recognition errors.

Multilingual LibriSpeech (MLS), French test split
  Two utterances (speakers 1406 and 296).
  Pratap, V., Xu, Q., Sriram, A., Synnaeve, G., Collobert, R.: MLS: A
  Large-Scale Multilingual Dataset for Speech Research. Interspeech 2020.
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/facebook/multilingual_librispeech
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: transcribed by machine (Nemotron 3.5 ASR Streaming) and, in the
  UI demo, translated by machine; the text contains recognition errors.

Files that contain this material:
  backend/tests/fixtures/nemo_diarize_en_fr.jsonl
  backend/tests/fixtures/nemo_single_en.jsonl
  backend/tests/test_transcript.py (short quotes)
  frontend/src/demo/nemoFixture.json
  frontend/scripts/nemo-to-fixture.mjs (short quotes)
  docs/media/demo.gif and the demo video linked from README.md (screen
  recording of a Session on this audio)
